rce of funds of business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-08","description":"SOF documents in relation to the applicant company are missing. Submit documents as to how the company is funded and by whom, including documents which show any funding/loans by the shareholder or third parties, as well as documents which show the funds owned by the company, though cashflow or other means","notes":"11/01/2025: Applicant`s reply: Please note that the documents submitted are from November 2023 through January 2024, as the shareholder/UBO was changed in December 2023 11/01/2025: @RCL please advise on the change of UBO since the current listed UBO is removed on 28-03-2024. RCL: The same UBO has been reinserted on the 3.11.2025. To request a most recent certified share ledger, to view any movements in UBO (or whether this removal was an error ). With Regards to SOF, the company appears to be funded by its operations- i) To request clarification of the Balance sheet uploaded for 'Traflow Media NV' and its relation to the applicant company (Possibly its a former name..?) ii) The comment of the applicant relating to the change in UBO in 2023, appears to refer to the former UBO who was not part of this application. A share transfer agreement for USD 50K was submitted. FS 2023 were also submitted, showing that the company is funded through its own revenue and therefore this CL may be closed."},{"title":"QPA/2024/02943 - Volodymyr Bakotskyi - Missing Documentation","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-22","description":"Please upload the application with the documentation requested.","notes":"11/01/2025: Please be advised that the Curriculum Vitae and the Engagement Letter is missing for the compliance officer. Please submit shortly. 11/15/2025: Documents have been submitted by the applicant."},{"title":"QPA/2024/02943 - Volodymyr Bakotskyi - Missing Documentation","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-12-02","description":"Please upload the application with the documentation requested.","notes":null},{"title":"Player Verification","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-11-08","description":"Since no Country of registration or age is required at registration stage please advise at what stage players are verified for underage and prohibited countries.","notes":"11/01/2025: Applicant`s reply: Verification is carried out at the deposit stage and additional verification at the withdrawal stage. RCL - reply accepted. To be tested during AML audit."},{"title":"QPA/2024/00886 - Arman Magoyan - Proof of address","tag":"Proof of Address","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-12-31","description":"Please submit a utility bill as proof of address.","notes":"Closed to rejection [Gerald Chocolaad - 05-05-2026 13:04]"}]}]}]}